 Assumptions\\n- Refresh mechanism is currently tied to view reset\\n- Likely requires decoupling data refresh from view state\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Complete UI/UX redesign\\n- Changing data refresh frequency\\n- Modifying existing data fetch mechanisms\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n- Zero unexpected view shifts during data refresh\\n- User reports improved experience\\n- No introduction of new performance bottlenecks"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_017PSbeLvfHN9EF5LcmL1juZ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix', 'description': "Fix the timeline page data refresh issue that disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes. Maintain user's current view/scroll position while ensuring real-time data updates occur without visual interruption."}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_017PSbeLvfHN9EF5LcmL1juZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "b7da20a2", "message": "Created project: Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "summary": {"project_id": "b7da20a2", "project_name": "Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "description": "Fix the timeline page data refresh issue that disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes. Maintain user\'s current view/scroll position while ensuring real-time data updates occur without visual interruption.", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T00:19:19.889073", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T00:19:19.889073", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:19:19.889073", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01BLqDMgD6hTqL4tDNdnbk7f', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': "# Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nFix the timeline page data refresh issue that disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes. Maintain user's current view/scroll position while ensuring real-time data updates occur without visual interruption.\n\n## Milestone Breakdown\n\n### Milestone 1: Investigation & Architecture (Week 1)\n**Objective**: Analyze current implementation and design solution architecture\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Current code analysis document\n- Root cause identification \n- Technical architecture for fix\n- Implementation plan\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Understanding of why data refresh triggers view changes\n- Clear technical approach identified\n- Architecture approved for implementation\n- No breaking changes to existing API\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n### Milestone 2: Core Fix Implementation (Week 2)\n**Objective**: Implement the core fix to decouple data refresh from view state\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Modified timeline component with preserved view state\n- Data refresh mechanism that doesn't affect scroll position\n- Unit tests for new functionality\n- Integration tests\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Data refreshes without changing user's view position\n- All existing functionality preserved\n- Tests pass with 100% coverage on new code\n- No performance regression\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 complete\n\n### Milestone 3: Testing & Polish (Week 3)\n**Objective**: Comprehensive testing and user experience validation\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- End-to-end tests covering all refresh scenarios\n- Performance benchmarks\n- User acceptance testing results\n- Documentation updates\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Zero view shifts during data refresh in all test scenarios\n- Performance overhead < 5ms per refresh\n- User testing shows improved experience\n- Documentation updated\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 complete\n\n## Risk Assessment\n- **Low Risk**: Well-defined problem with clear scope\n- **Technical Risk**: Potential coupling between data and view layers\n- **Mitigation**: Thorough analysis phase before implementation\n\n## Timeline\n- **Total Duration**: 3 weeks\n- **Resource Requirements**: Frontend developer, testing resources\n- **Critical Path**: Investigation → Implementation → Testing\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Zero unexpected view shifts during data refresh\n- User reports improved experience  \n- No introduction of new performance bottlenecks\n- 100% test coverage on modified components"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01BLqDMgD6hTqL4tDNdnbk7f', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_001931.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_001931.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Nki9S4KHJsijocpJmvktHh', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_directory': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output', 'project_name': 'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Nki9S4KHJsijocpJmvktHh', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: output_file"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu