d to implement milestone 1 (Investigation & Architecture). The project uses a Data-View Separation pattern with React hooks to decouple data refresh from view state management, preventing unwanted scrolling while maintaining real-time updates. Implementation is now in progress.",\n  "self_analysis": "Successfully executed the complete development management workflow from requirements analysis through architecture and task breakdown. I effectively coordinated with System Architect and all three Coordinators to break down the timeline focus fix project into comprehensive, actionable tasks. The spawning of TDD Coordinator for implementation shows proper delegation and process execution.",\n  "performance_analysis": "System Architect delivered excellent architecture with clear Data-View Separation pattern and React hooks implementation strategy. Frontend Coordinator provided detailed 10-task breakdown with proper dependencies. Test Coordinator created comprehensive testing strategy with 85% unit coverage goals. Backend Coordinator identified 5 key implementation tasks with clear dependencies. All agents performed well with focused, actionable outputs."\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'user', 'content': "Good progress! You reported status='in_progress' and phase='implementation'. Please continue with the next step. Use the appropriate tools to proceed with implementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LoJs5hVB39zhMYcHhMsD1X', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': 'b7da20a2'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LoJs5hVB39zhMYcHhMsD1X', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "b7da20a2", "project_name": "Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "description": "Fix the timeline page data refresh issue that disrupts user focus by changing the view every time d