lementation. Do not stop until all milestones are complete and status='success' with phase='complete'."}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LoJs5hVB39zhMYcHhMsD1X', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'get_summary', 'project_id': 'b7da20a2'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LoJs5hVB39zhMYcHhMsD1X', 'content': '{"success": true, "summary": {"project_id": "b7da20a2", "project_name": "Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "description": "Fix the timeline page data refresh issue that disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes. Maintain user\'s current view/scroll position while ensuring real-time data updates occur without visual interruption.", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T00:19:19.889073", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T00:23:21.900430", "task_counts": {"total": 1, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 1, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:23:21.900422", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Task \'Investigation & Architecture - Complete milestone 1 tasks including current implementation analysis, root cause investigation, and solution architecture design\' status: todo \\u2192 in_progress - TDD Coordinator spawned to implement milestone 1 tasks - investigation and architecture phase", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:23:18.628781", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Added task: Investigation & Architecture - Complete milestone 1 tasks including current implementation analysis, root cause investigation, and solution architecture design", "category": "general"}, {"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:19:19.889073", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_013XfiJ