one"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UXs8Zbqoj3UHcyAR4JMC4d', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': "# Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix Requirements\n\n## User Problem\nThe timeline page currently disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes, causing a poor user experience.\n\n## Objectives\n1. Prevent automatic scrolling/view changes during data refresh\n2. Maintain user's current view/scroll position\n3. Ensure data updates occur without visual interruption\n\n## Constraints\n- Preserve real-time data updates\n- Minimal performance impact\n- Compatible with existing timeline component\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- User's current view remains stable during data refresh\n- No unexpected scrolling or repositioning\n- Data updates occur smoothly in the background\n- Performance overhead is negligible\n\n## Assumptions\n- Refresh mechanism is currently tied to view reset\n- Likely requires decoupling data refresh from view state\n\n## Out of Scope\n- Complete UI/UX redesign\n- Changing data refresh frequency\n- Modifying existing data fetch mechanisms\n\n## Success Metrics\n- Zero unexpected view shifts during data refresh\n- User reports improved experience\n- No introduction of new performance bottlenecks"}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UXs8Zbqoj3UHcyAR4JMC4d', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_001908.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_001908.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'c