{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 00:29:15", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-69654e77-0f88-4c67-9fbc-23688fb4d79f', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "project_id": "088a1756",\n  "project_name": "Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix",\n  "requirements_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md",\n  "implementation_spec": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/implementation_spec.md",\n  "target_file": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/HorizontalTimelineView.jsx",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "Implement scroll preservation during periodic data refreshes to prevent user view disruption"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01AjPLT5bXvJbJVk5jBFSxZt', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AjPLT5bXvJbJVk5jBFSxZt', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix Requirements\\n\\n## User Problem\\nThe timeline page currently disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes, causing a poor user experience.\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. Prevent automatic scrolling/view changes during data refresh\\n2. Maintain user\'s current view/scroll position\\n3. Ensure data updates occur without visual interruption\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Preserve real-time data updates\\n- Minimal performance impact\\n- Compatible with existing timeline component\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- User\'s current view remains stable during data refresh\\n- No unexpected scrolling or repositioning\\n- Data updates occur smoothly in the background\\n- Performance overhead is negligible\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Refresh mechanism is currently tied to view reset\\n- Likely requires decoupling data refresh from view state\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Complete UI/UX redesign\\n- Changing data refresh frequency\\n- Modifying existing data fetch mechanisms\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n- Zero unexpected view shifts during data refresh\\n- User reports improved experience\\n- No introduction of new performance bottlenecks"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01APoSNcP5duRcPACWakKX5z', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/implementation_spec.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01APoSNcP5duRcPACWakKX5z', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Implementation Specification: Timeline Scroll Preservation\\n\\n## Objective\\nModify HorizontalTimelineView component to maintain user\'s scroll position during periodic data refreshes.\\n\\n## Required Changes in `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/components/HorizontalTimelineView.jsx`\\n\\n### 1. Import Updates\\n```javascript\\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useCallback } from \'react\';\\n```\\n\\n### 2. State and Ref Management\\n- Add new refs to track scroll position:\\n```javascript\\nconst containerRef = useRef(null);\\nconst scrollPositionRef = useRef({ x: 0, y: 0 });\\n```\\n\\n### 3. Scroll Preservation Methods\\nImplement two new methods:\\n```javascript\\nconst preserveScrollPosition = useCallback(() => {\\n  if (containerRef.current) {\\n    scrollPositionRef.current = {\\n      x: containerRef.current.scrollLeft,\\n      y: containerRef.current.scrollTop\\n    };\\n  }\\n}, []);\\n\\nconst restoreScrollPosition = useCallback(() => {\\n  if (containerRef.current) {\\n    containerRef.current.scrollLeft = scrollPositionRef.current.x;\\n    containerRef.current.scrollTop = scrollPositionRef.current.y;\\n  }\\n}, []);\\n```\\n\\n### 4. Modify `useEffect` for Request Fetching\\nUpdate to preserve scroll state:\\n```javascript\\nuseEffect(() => {\\n  const fetchRequests = async () => {\\n    try {\\n      preserveScrollPosition();\\n      const response = await fetch(\'http://localhost:8001/api/requests?limit=20\');\\n      // Existing fetch logic\\n      \\n      setTimeout(restoreScrollPosition, 0);\\n    } catch (error) {\\n      // Existing error handling\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  fetchRequests();\\n  const interval = setInterval(fetchRequests, 2000);\\n  return () => clearInterval(interval);\\n}, [preserveScrollPosition, restoreScrollPosition, selectedRequest]);\\n```\\n\\n### 5. Container Ref Update\\nModify container div to use new ref:\\n```javascript\\n<div\\n  ref={containerRef}\\n  style={{\\n    flex: 1,\\n    overflowX: \'auto\',\\n    overflowY: \'auto\',\\n    padding: \'20px\'\\n  }}\\n>\\n  {/* Existing content */}\\n</div>\\n```\\n\\n## Testing Requirements\\n1. Verify scroll position remains stable during periodic refreshes\\n2. Test with long timeline and varied scroll positions\\n3. Ensure no performance degradation\\n4. Validate across different browsers\\n\\n## Performance Considerations\\n- Use `useCallback` to memoize scroll methods\\n- Minimal overhead with `setTimeout` for scroll restoration\\n- Preserve existing component logic\\n\\n## Browser Compatibility\\n- Modern browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)\\n- React 17+ recommended\\n- ES6+ environment required"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01LCK7ESkzZnBYhp82DkGJia', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix', 'description': 'Implement scroll preservation during periodic data refreshes to prevent user view disruption'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01LCK7ESkzZnBYhp82DkGJia', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "c3e07b6e", "message": "Created project: Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "summary": {"project_id": "c3e07b6e", "project_name": "Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix", "description": "Implement scroll preservation during periodic data refreshes to prevent user view disruption", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T00:27:44.109398", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T00:27:44.109398", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:27:44.109398", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01SFY9mPJPecrXYLPnofMCNo', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'coordinators/frontend_coordinator', 'input_data': {'project_name': 'Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix', 'milestone': 'Implement scroll preservation in HorizontalTimelineView', 'requirements': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'implementation_spec': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/implementation_spec.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/frontend_tasks_m1.md'}}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01SFY9mPJPecrXYLPnofMCNo', 'content': '{"success": false, "error": "Missing required input field: architectu