lementation of Achievement Audit and Cleanup milestone with TDD approach", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "34 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "46626a3b770fb56781a8af825cf8a158764b5350", "message": "Milestone 1 implementation begin: Prepared directories, spawned coordinators, and initiated TDD process for Achievement Consolidation", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "35 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "3bd28764e6f06fc8c986a4320410f7828dc12bc0", "message": "Milestone 1 planning for Achievement Consolidation: Finalized architecture, milestone plan, and task breakdowns for backend and testing", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "37 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "8051fe315ddd7ca04ebf7c55f477044c2cdc5981", "message": "Add requirements for achievement system consolidation and expansion", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "39 minutes ago"}, {"hash": "f57958ab035753c52bf7a1402397e2e762bcb061", "message": "Complete Milestone 1 setup: API Cost Optimization research and documentation phase initiated", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "7e54be9371ee12a85485c76535564da32a2e0fe3", "message": "Initial project setup for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "f5c30d44529777f9401b64f6a436c04296771d2d", "message": "Complete Milestone 3: Full CLI Integration and Polish for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "0b91cf675d9906a8b0d3971d312bc2549ffe1100", "message": "Complete Milestone 3: Full CLI Integration and Polish for Tmux Monitoring Dashboard - implemented Claude CLI integration, advanced log processing, configuration management system, robust error handling, and cross-platform compatibility features", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "017db01e1eedbe015d976d87c4730760912bd86f", "message": "Complete Milestone 2 Integration and Testing: comprehensive testing achieved with 95% coverage and sub-millisecond performance", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "476015b52cdfb1c8c2660e0bbaa7fbf0e548e992", "message": "Complete Milestone 2: Enhanced Task Monitoring with real-time tracking", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "7f7ce8b59169360f3b44a54332e854f54acb860c", "message": "Complete TDD Coordinator model validation with comprehensive performance report", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "80509b30d6cd7a13eaa6c9d5f9cfcf3668dedf9a", "message": "Complete backend implementation and testing for TDD Coordinator model validation A/B testing framework", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "b72edcd8bdc67384c51b097bf4f11919bcaff5c8", "message": "Complete Milestone 1: Basic Tmux Layout for Monitoring Dashboard", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "24e4cfbfe17daa33a6ee682dee447d88770e5f8d", "message": "Complete milestone 3: final deployment preparation for activity tracking system", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "282711affb101f9a14d654eb0691b7ed2cade355", "message": "Prepare final deployment package for activity tracking system with comprehensive requirements and deployment instructions", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "1ca876e0c7da20a2ba22cb1eddc5b81ab6786156", "message": "Complete milestone 2: comprehensive integration testing for activity tracking system", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}, {"hash": "db7897db012286d819174b33609ec1e9edd6bbe4", "message": "Complete implementation milestone: Loser Board feature with backend, frontend, and test suite", "author": "Matt Billock", "when": "2 hours ago"}], "stash_count": 0}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_011oUa14KsDxq3Grf3jnFfaJ', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_011oUa14KsDxq3Grf3jnFfaJ', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix Requirements\\n\\n## User Problem\\nThe timeline page currently disrupts user focus by changing the view every time data refreshes, causing a poor user experience.\\n\\n## Objectives\\n1. Prevent automatic scrolling/view changes during data refresh\\n2. Maintain user\'s current view/scroll position\\n3. Ensure data updates occur without visual interruption\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- Preserve real-time data updates\\n- Minimal performance impact\\n- Compatible with existing timeline component\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n- User\'s current view remains stable during data refresh\\n- No unexpected scrolling or repositioning\\n- Data updates occur smoothly in the background\\n- Performance overhead is negligible\\n\\n## Assumptions\\n- Refresh mechanism is currently tied to view reset\\n- Likely requires decoupling data refresh from view state\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Complete UI/UX redesign\\n- Changing data refresh frequency\\n- Modifying existing data fetch mechanisms\\n\\n## Success Metrics\\n- Zero unexpected view shifts during data refresh\\n- User reports improved experience\\n- No introduction of new performance bottlenecks"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: write_file will reject your request with PermissionError\n\n**WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU TRY TO WRITE CODE:**\nThe system will block you with error: "Agent \'Executive Director\' lacks can_write_code permission but attempted to write code file: {filename}"\n\n### Directory Structure\n\n**CRITICAL - READ FIRST**: See [Directory Structure Guide](/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/docs/DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md) for complete file organization rules.\n\n**Your Allowed Write Locations**:\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md` - Project requirements\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md` - Milestone planning\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/status_reports.md` - Status reports\n✓ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/[feature-name]/` - Feature-specific documentation\n\n**FORBIDDEN Write Locations** (delegate to Development Manager):\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/frontend/src/` - Frontend code (React components)\n✗ `/src/field/ensemble_ui/backend/` - Backend code (Python/FastAPI)\n✗ `/tests/` - Test files\n✗ `/src/runtime/` - Runtime system code\n\n**When Spawning Development Manager**, provide correct paths:\n\n\n### Process:\n\n**Phase 0: Create Project**\n1. **FIRST THING**: Create project in tracking system to maintain state\n   \n   This returns a `project_id` - **SAVE IT** for all future tracking calls\n2. Throughout execution, record notes about decisions and progress:\n   \n\n**Phase 1: Requirements**\n3. Read user vision, identify core problem/solution\n4. Gather details: features, users, constraints, success criteria, out-of-scope\n5. **BE DECISIVE**: Make reasonable assumptions for missing details - ONLY ask user if requirements are genuinely 