{"timestamp": "2026-01-17 00:49:57", "level": "DEBUG", "module": "anthropic._base_client", "message": "Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-ad756d89-0025-4ce0-9404-0532e094ab8e', 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Please complete the following task:\n\n{\n  "user_vision": "Implement a UI theming system",\n  "output_directory": "/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output",\n  "context": "User submitted problem via web UI"\n}\n\nRemember to respond with valid JSON matching the expected output format.\n'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_015Mmm4B6d3ihQTUoSfLAETS', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'create_project', 'project_name': 'UI Theming System', 'description': 'Implement a comprehensive UI theming system to allow users to customize the visual appearance of the interface'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_015Mmm4B6d3ihQTUoSfLAETS', 'content': '{"success": true, "project_id": "97fd6b2b", "message": "Created project: UI Theming System", "summary": {"project_id": "97fd6b2b", "project_name": "UI Theming System", "description": "Implement a comprehensive UI theming system to allow users to customize the visual appearance of the interface", "status": "active", "created_at": "2026-01-17T00:49:22.295381", "updated_at": "2026-01-17T00:49:22.295381", "task_counts": {"total": 0, "todo": 0, "in_progress": 0, "completed": 0, "blocked": 0, "cancelled": 0}, "completion_percentage": 0.0, "recent_notes": [{"timestamp": "2026-01-17T00:49:22.295381", "author": "executive_director", "note": "Project \'UI Theming System\' created", "category": "milestone"}], "output_directory": null}}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01CK8NXWgsQF12wWYtJZqVjW', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '97fd6b2b', 'category': 'general', 'note': 'Project initiated for UI theming system implementation. User submitted via web UI. Output directory: /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01CK8NXWgsQF12wWYtJZqVjW', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01Q6QrEjVKVKzKStAVNc71eJ', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'content': '# UI Theming System - Requirements Document\n\n## Project Vision\nImplement a comprehensive UI theming system that allows users to customize the visual appearance of the application interface. This system should provide multiple pre-built themes and the ability to create custom themes.\n\n## Core Objectives\n1. **Theme Management**: Provide a system to load, apply, and switch between different visual themes\n2. **Pre-built Themes**: Include multiple professionally designed themes (light, dark, high contrast)\n3. **Custom Theme Creation**: Allow users to create and save custom themes\n4. **Real-time Preview**: Provide instant visual feedback when customizing themes\n5. **Persistence**: Save user theme preferences and custom themes\n\n## Functional Requirements\n\n### Theme Components\n- **Color Schemes**: Primary, secondary, accent colors, backgrounds, text colors\n- **Typography**: Font families, sizes, weights, line heights\n- **Spacing**: Margins, padding, component spacing\n- **Border Styles**: Border radius, border widths, shadow effects\n- **Interactive States**: Hover, focus, active, disabled states\n\n### User Features\n- **Theme Selector**: Dropdown or gallery view to browse and select themes\n- **Theme Editor**: Visual interface to customize theme properties\n- **Color Picker**: Advanced color selection with palette generation\n- **Preview Mode**: Live preview of theme changes before applying\n- **Export/Import**: Save themes as JSON files for sharing\n- **Reset Functionality**: Restore default themes or revert changes\n\n### System Features\n- **CSS Variable Integration**: Use CSS custom properties for dynamic theming\n- **Component Integration**: Ensure all UI components support theming\n- **Performance Optimization**: Efficient theme switching without page reload\n- **Accessibility Compliance**: Maintain WCAG 2.1 AA contrast requirements\n- **Responsive Design**: Themes work across all device sizes\n\n## Technical Requirements\n\n### Frontend (React)\n- **Theme Provider**: React Context for theme state management\n- **Theme Hook**: Custom hook for accessing current theme\n- **CSS-in-JS Support**: Styled-components or similar for dynamic styling\n- **Local Storage**: Persist theme preferences client-side\n- **Theme Validation**: Ensure theme data integrity and accessibility\n\n### Backend (Python/FastAPI)\n- **Theme API**: Endpoints for saving/loading custom themes\n- **User Preferences**: Store theme preferences in user profiles\n- **Theme Validation**: Server-side validation of theme data\n- **Default Themes**: Serve pre-built theme configurations\n\n### Data Model\n```json\n{\n  "theme_id": "string",\n  "name": "string",\n  "description": "string",\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#hex",\n    "secondary": "#hex",\n    "background": "#hex",\n    "surface": "#hex",\n    "text_primary": "#hex",\n    "text_secondary": "#hex",\n    "error": "#hex",\n    "warning": "#hex",\n    "success": "#hex"\n  },\n  "typography": {\n    "font_family": "string",\n    "font_size_base": "number",\n    "line_height": "number",\n    "font_weights": {}\n  },\n  "spacing": {\n    "base_unit": "number",\n    "scale_factor": "number"\n  },\n  "borders": {\n    "radius": "number",\n    "width": "number"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Non-Functional Requirements\n\n### Performance\n- Theme switching should occur within 200ms\n- No visual flash or layout shift during theme changes\n- Minimal impact on page load times\n\n### Accessibility\n- Maintain minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio for normal text\n- Maintain minimum 3:1 contrast ratio for large text\n- Support high contrast mode for accessibility\n- Keyboard navigation for theme selection\n- Screen reader compatibility\n\n### Browser Support\n- Modern browsers (Chrome 90+, Firefox 88+, Safari 14+, Edge 90+)\n- CSS custom properties support required\n- Local storage support required\n\n### Security\n- Sanitize theme data to prevent XSS\n- Validate color values and CSS properties\n- Rate limiting on theme save operations\n\n## Success Criteria\n1. **User Adoption**: Users can successfully switch between themes\n2. **Customization**: Users can create and save custom themes\n3. **Performance**: No performance degradation with theming enabled\n4. **Accessibility**: All themes meet accessibility standards\n5. **Integration**: Theming works across all application components\n\n## Assumptions Made\n- **Technology Stack**: Using React frontend with CSS-in-JS styling\n- **Storage**: Local storage for client-side persistence, database for user accounts\n- **Design System**: Existing component library that can be themed\n- **User Authentication**: User accounts exist for saving custom themes\n- **Browser Compatibility**: Targeting modern browsers with CSS custom property support\n\n## Out of Scope\n- **Advanced Animations**: Complex transition effects during theme switching\n- **Theme Marketplace**: Sharing themes between users (future feature)\n- **Advanced Typography**: Custom font uploads or extensive typography controls\n- **Print Themes**: Specialized themes for printing\n- **Mobile App Theming**: Native mobile application theming\n\n## Constraints\n- **Performance Budget**: Theme system should not increase page load time by more than 100ms\n- **File Size**: Theme files should not exceed 50KB each\n- **Browser Memory**: Minimize memory usage when multiple themes are loaded\n- **Accessibility**: All themes must pass automated accessibility testing\n\n## Dependencies\n- **Component Library**: Existing UI components must support theme variables\n- **Design System**: Design tokens and style guide for consistent theming\n- **User System**: User authentication and preferences storage\n- **API Infrastructure**: Backend endpoints for theme management\n\n## Deliverables\n1. **Theme Management System**: Core theming infrastructure\n2. **Pre-built Themes**: Light, dark, and high contrast themes\n3. **Theme Editor Interface**: User interface for theme customization\n4. **Documentation**: Developer and user documentation\n5. **Test Suite**: Comprehensive testing including accessibility tests\n6. **Migration Guide**: Instructions for applying themes to existing components'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01Q6QrEjVKVKzKStAVNc71eJ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_004951.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements_20260117_004951.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01SuGx6AjrQtSLUYNswZRZbZ', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': '97fd6b2b', 'category': 'milestone', 'note': 'Requirements document completed. Defined comprehensive theming system with color schemes, typography, spacing, theme editor, and accessibility compliance. Ready for development phase.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01SuGx6AjrQtSLUYNswZRZbZ', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_018o34Phn7Yy3gYvKVr66zss', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_018o34Phn7Yy3gYvKVr66zss', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# UI Theming System - Requirements Document\\n\\n## Project Vision\\nImplement a comprehensive UI theming system that allows users to customize the visual appearance of the application interface. This system should provide multiple pre-built themes and the ability to create custom themes.\\n\\n## Core Objectives\\n1. **Theme Management**: Provide a system to load, apply, and switch between different visual themes\\n2. **Pre-built Themes**: Include multiple professionally designed themes (light, dark, high contrast)\\n3. **Custom Theme Creation**: Allow users to create and save custom themes\\n4. **Real-time Preview**: Provide instant visual feedback when customizing themes\\n5. **Persistence**: Save user theme preferences and custom themes\\n\\n## Functional Requirements\\n\\n### Theme Components\\n- **Color Schemes**: Primary, secondary, accent colors, backgrounds, text colors\\n- **Typography**: Font families, sizes, weights, line heights\\n- **Spacing**: Margins, padding, component spacing\\n- **Border Styles**: Border radius, border widths, shadow effects\\n- **Interactive States**: Hover, focus, active, disabled states\\n\\n### User Features\\n- **Theme Selector**: Dropdown or gallery view to browse and select themes\\n- **Theme Editor**: Visual interface to customize theme properties\\n- **Color Picker**: Advanced color selection with palette generation\\n- **Preview Mode**: Live preview of theme changes before applying\\n- **Export/Import**: Save themes as JSON files for sharing\\n- **Reset Functionality**: Restore default themes or revert changes\\n\\n### System Features\\n- **CSS Variable Integration**: Use CSS custom properties for dynamic theming\\n- **Component Integration**: Ensure all UI components support theming\\n- **Performance Optimization**: Efficient theme switching without page reload\\n- **Accessibility Compliance**: Maintain WCAG 2.1 AA contrast requirements\\n- **Responsive Design**: Themes work across all device sizes\\n\\n## Technical Requirements\\n\\n### Frontend (React)\\n- **Theme Provider**: React Context for theme state management\\n- **Theme Hook**: Custom hook for accessing current theme\\n- **CSS-in-JS Support**: Styled-components or similar for dynamic styling\\n- **Local Storage**: Persist theme preferences client-side\\n- **Theme Validation**: Ensure theme data integrity and accessibility\\n\\n### Backend (Python/FastAPI)\\n- **Theme API**: Endpoints for saving/loading custom themes\\n- **User Preferences**: Store theme preferences in user profiles\\n- **Theme Validation**: Server-side validation of theme data\\n- **Default Themes**: Serve pre-built theme configurations\\n\\n### Data Model\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\"theme_id\\": \\"string\\",\\n  \\"name\\": \\"string\\",\\n  \\"description\\": \\"string\\",\\n  \\"colors\\": {\\n    \\"primary\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"secondary\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"background\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"surface\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"text_primary\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"text_secondary\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"error\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"warning\\": \\"#hex\\",\\n    \\"success\\": \\"#hex\\"\\n  },\\n  \\"typography\\": {\\n    \\"font_family\\": \\"string\\",\\n    \\"font_size_base\\": \\"number\\",\\n    \\"line_height\\": \\"number\\",\\n    \\"font_weights\\": {}\\n  },\\n  \\"spacing\\": {\\n    \\"base_unit\\": \\"number\\",\\n    \\"scale_factor\\": \\"number\\"\\n  },\\n  \\"borders\\": {\\n    \\"radius\\": \\"number\\",\\n    \\"width\\": \\"number\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n## Non-Functional Requirements\\n\\n### Performance\\n- Theme switching should occur within 200ms\\n- No visual flash or layout shift during theme changes\\n- Minimal impact on page load times\\n\\n### Accessibility\\n- Maintain minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio for normal text\\n- Maintain minimum 3:1 contrast ratio for large text\\n- Support high contrast mode for accessibility\\n- Keyboard navigation for theme selection\\n- Screen reader compatibility\\n\\n### Browser Support\\n- Modern browsers (Chrome 90+, Firefox 88+, Safari 14+, Edge 90+)\\n- CSS custom properties support required\\n- Local storage support required\\n\\n### Security\\n- Sanitize theme data to prevent XSS\\n- Validate color values and CSS properties\\n- Rate limiting on theme save operations\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n1. **User Adoption**: Users can successfully switch between themes\\n2. **Customization**: Users can create and save custom themes\\n3. **Performance**: No performance degradation with theming enabled\\n4. **Accessibility**: All themes meet accessibility standards\\n5. **Integration**: Theming works across all application components\\n\\n## Assumptions Made\\n- **Technology Stack**: Using React frontend with CSS-in-JS styling\\n- **Storage**: Local storage for client-side persistence, database for user accounts\\n- **Design System**: Existing component library that can be themed\\n- **User Authentication**: User accounts exist for saving custom themes\\n- **Browser Compatibility**: Targeting modern browsers with CSS custom property support\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- **Advanced Animations**: Complex transition effects during theme switching\\n- **Theme Marketplace**: Sharing themes between users (future feature)\\n- **Advanced Typography**: Custom font uploads or extensive typography controls\\n- **Print Themes**: Specialized themes for printing\\n- **Mobile App Theming**: Native mobile application theming\\n\\n## Constraints\\n- **Performance Budget**: Theme system should not increase page load time by more than 100ms\\n- **File Size**: Theme files should not exceed 50KB each\\n- **Browser Memory**: Minimize memory usage when multiple themes are loaded\\n- **Accessibility**: All themes must pass automated accessibility testing\\n\\n## Dependencies\\n- **Component Library**: Existing UI components must support theme variables\\n- **Design System**: Design tokens and style guide for consistent theming\\n- **User System**: User authentication and preferences storage\\n- **API Infrastructure**: Backend endpoints for theme management\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n1. **Theme Management System**: Core theming infrastructure\\n2. **Pre-built Themes**: Light, dark, and high contrast themes\\n3. **Theme Editor Interface**: User interface for theme customization\\n4. **Documentation**: Developer and user documentation\\n5. **Test Suite**: Comprehensive testing including accessibility tests\\n6. **Migration Guide**: Instructions for applying themes to existing components"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt write_file with test extensions**: .test.js, .test.jsx, .spec.js, test_*.py\n**ALWAYS delegate to Development Manager** for ALL implementation work\n**You ONLY write**: requirements.md, architecture.md, milestone_plan.md, status_reports.md\n**If spawn_agent fails**: Report error to user and STOP - DO NOT try to write code yourself as workaround\n**If you try to write code**: