ool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01EpNV3frFPK9xEaZQYURh6X', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Frontend Tasks: Timeline Scroll Preservation\\n\\n## Task 1: Create Scroll Position Management Hook\\n- **Description**: Implement `useViewState` custom hook for scroll position tracking\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Hook provides methods to preserve and restore scroll position\\n  * Supports both vertical and horizontal scroll tracking\\n  * Minimal performance overhead\\n- **Dependencies**: None\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Estimated Time**: 2-4 hours\\n\\n## Task 2: Implement Data Refresh Controller Hook\\n- **Description**: Create `useDataRefresh` hook to manage data refresh without view disruption\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Controls data refresh lifecycle\\n  * Prevents unnecessary re-renders\\n  * Provides refresh status and last update timestamp\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1 (Scroll Position Hook)\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Estimated Time**: 3-5 hours\\n\\n## Task 3: Create Memoized Timeline Items Component\\n- **Description**: Develop optimized timeline items component with selective rendering\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Uses React.memo for performance\\n  * Generates stable keys for items\\n  * Conditionally updates only when data changes\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n- **Estimated Time**: 4-6 hours\\n\\n## Task 4: Update Timeline Container\\n- **Description**: Modify existing HorizontalTimelineView to integrate new scroll preservation logic\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Preserves user\'s scroll position during data refresh\\n  * No unexpected view shifts\\n  * Maintains existing functionality\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 1, Task 2, Task 3\\n- **Complexity**: Complex\\n- **Estimated Time**: 5-7 hours\\n\\n## Task 5: Implement Performance Monitoring\\n- **Description**: Add analytics and performance tracking for scroll preservation\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Tracks view stability events\\n  * Monitors render time overhead\\n  * Collects anonymous usage data for improvement\\n- **Dependencies**: Task 4\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Estimated Time**: 2-4 hours\\n\\n## Task 6: Cross-Browser Testing\\n- **Description**: Comprehensive testing across different browsers and devices\\n- **Acceptance Criteria**:\\n  * Verified on Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge\\n  * Consistent behavior on desktop and mobile\\n  * No performance regressions\\n- **Dependencies**: All previous tasks\\n- **Complexity**: Medium\\n- **Estimated Time**: 4-6 hours\\n\\n## Total Estimated Effort\\n- **Development Time**: 16-32 hours\\n- **Calendar Time**: 1-2 weeks\\n- **Complexity**: High precision refactoring\\n\\n## Recommended Implementation Order\\n1. Task 1: Scroll Position Hook\\n2. Task 2: Data Refresh Controller\\n3. Task 3: Memoized Timeline Items\\n4. Task 4: Timeline Container Update\\n5. Task 5: Performance Monitoring\\n6. Task 6: Cross-Browser Testing\\n\\n## Open Questions for Clarification\\n1. What is the acceptable performance overhead for scroll preservation?\\n2. Are there any specific browsers or devices of particular concern?\\n3. Should we implement a fallback mechanism for scroll restoration failures?"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01ShGbdPzKxcCZa9oin2Vsa9', 'name': 'read_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/test_tasks_m1.md'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01ShGbdPzKxcCZa9oin2Vsa9', 'content': '{"success": true, "content": "# Test Strategy: Timeline Page Data Refresh Focus Fix\\n\\n## Objective\\nEnsure scroll preservation in HorizontalTimelineView during data refresh, preventing user focus disruption.\\n\\n## Test Coverage Strategy\\n- **Unit Test Coverage**: 90% for custom hooks and utility functions\\n- **Integration Test Coverage**: 100% for view state management\\n- **End-to-End Test Coverage**: Critical user interaction flows\\n\\n## Test Task Breakdown\\n\\n### 1. useViewState Hook Tests\\n- [ ] Verify scroll position tracking\\n- [ ] Test position preservation mechanism\\n- [ ] Validate scroll restoration functionality\\n- [ ] Check memory management and cleanup\\n\\n### 2. useDataRefresh Hook Tests\\n- [ ] Validate data refresh without view disruption\\n- [ ] Test refresh state management\\n- [ ] Verify performance during rapid successive refreshes\\n- [ ] Ensure no unexpected re-renders\\n\\n### 3. TimelineContainer Component Tests\\n- [ ] Confirm view state isolation\\n- [ ] Test integration of view state and data refresh\\n- [ ] Validate memoization effectiveness\\n- [ ] Check cross-browser scroll behavior\\n\\n### 4. Performance and Edge Case Tests\\n- [ ] Measure render time overhead\\n- [ ] Test with large datasets\\n- [ ] Validate behavior under slow network conditions\\n- [ ] Check memory usage during extended use\\n\\n### 5. End-to-End Interaction Tests\\n- [ ] Simulate real-world user scrolling during data refresh\\n- [ ] Test multiple rapid data updates\\n- [ ] Verify no unexpected view shifts\\n- [ ] Validate smooth user experience\\n\\n## Testing Tools and Frameworks\\n- **Unit Testing**: Jest + React Testing Library\\n- **Performance Testing**: React DevTools Profiler\\n- **E2E Testing**: Playwright\\n- **Scroll Simulation**: Custom scroll event generators\\n\\n## Specific Test Scenarios\\n\\n### Positive Scenarios\\n1. User scrolls midway through timeline\\n2. Data refresh occurs without changing scroll position\\n3. Multiple rapid data updates\\n4. Large dataset with continuous updates\\n\\n### Negative/Edge Scenarios\\n1. Extremely fast scroll during refresh\\n2. Refresh during scroll momentum\\n3. Low-performance devices\\n4. Interrupted network conditions\\n\\n## Performance Benchmarks\\n- **Render Time**: &lt; 5ms overhead\\n- **Memory Usage**: No significant increase\\n- **Scroll Smoothness**: 60 FPS minimum\\n\\n## Risk Mitigation Tests\\n- Verify fallback mechanisms\\n- Test feature flag integration\\n- Validate graceful degradation\\n\\n## Recommended Test Sequence\\n1. Unit tests for individual hooks\\n2. Component integration tests\\n3. Performance benchmark tests\\n4. End-to-end user flow tests\\n5. Cross-browser compatibility tests\\n\\n## Out of Scope\\n- Complete UI redesign testing\\n- Testing unrelated components\\n- Network layer testing beyond current implementation\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n- Comprehensive test coverage report\\n- Performance metrics documentation\\n- Recommendations for further optimization"}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01158rg78fd7hHZVoeMh4VyL', 'name': 'project_tracking', 'input': {'action': 'add_note', 'project_id': 'ae8d6a4b', 'category': 'issue', 'note': 'Implementation appears incomplete: Only basic prop handling added to HorizontalTimelineView.jsx. Missing core scroll preservation hooks (useViewState, useDataRefresh), TimelineContainer wrapper component, and comprehensive testing. Need to complete implementation according to architecture and task specifications.'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01158rg78fd7hHZVoeMh4VyL', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "Added note to project"}'}]}], 'model': 'claude-sonnet-4-20250514', 'system': 'You are a Executive Director agent.\n\n## Purpose\nMeta-orchestrator for entire ensemble. Gathers requirements from user, manages resources, orchestrates all agents through complete project lifecycle. Reports to user at key decision points.\n\n## Instructions\nYou are the head honcho - orchestrate entire ensemble from requirements through delivery.\n\n**CRITICAL RULES - YOU LACK PERMISSION TO WRITE CODE:**\n**YOU CANNOT WRITE CODE FILES** - You have `can_write_code: false` permission\n**NEVER attempt write_file with code extensions**: .py, .js, .jsx, .ts, .tsx, .java, .rb, .go, .rs, .cpp, .c, .h\n**NEVER attempt