rwxr-xr-x@   7 mattbillock  staff    224 Jan 14 23:40 whimsical-agent-names\\n", "stderr": ""}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01UCL7PgJEWVZq9sBd27uA9s', 'name': 'write_file', 'input': {'file_path': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md', 'content': '# UI Theming System - Milestone Plan\n\n## Project Overview\nThis project implements a comprehensive UI theming system with multiple pre-built themes and custom theme creation capabilities.\n\n## Milestone 1: Core Theming Infrastructure (Week 1-2)\n**Objective**: Establish the foundation for the theming system with basic theme switching capabilities.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- CSS custom properties architecture\n- React theme context and provider\n- Basic theme hook implementation\n- Theme data model and validation\n- Local storage persistence\n- Basic theme loading/switching functionality\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Theme context can be consumed by any component\n- CSS custom properties update dynamically when theme changes\n- Theme preferences persist across browser sessions\n- Theme data validation prevents invalid configurations\n- No visual flash during theme switching\n\n**Dependencies**: None\n\n## Milestone 2: Pre-built Themes and Theme Selector (Week 3)\n**Objective**: Implement pre-built themes and user interface for theme selection.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Light, dark, and high contrast themes\n- Theme selector component (dropdown/gallery)\n- Theme preview functionality\n- Component integration with theming system\n- Accessibility compliance validation\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- All three pre-built themes are fully functional\n- Theme selector provides clear visual preview\n- All UI components properly respond to theme changes\n- WCAG 2.1 AA contrast requirements are met\n- Keyboard navigation works for theme selection\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 1 (core infrastructure)\n\n## Milestone 3: Custom Theme Creation and Editor (Week 4-5)\n**Objective**: Enable users to create, edit, and manage custom themes.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Theme editor interface\n- Color picker component\n- Typography and spacing controls\n- Real-time theme preview\n- Custom theme save/load functionality\n- Theme export/import (JSON)\n- Theme reset functionality\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Users can customize all theme properties\n- Real-time preview shows changes immediately\n- Custom themes can be saved and reloaded\n- Theme export/import works with valid JSON\n- Reset functionality restores original themes\n- Theme editor is accessible and intuitive\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 2 (theme selector and base themes)\n\n## Milestone 4: Backend Integration and User Preferences (Week 6)\n**Objective**: Integrate with backend for theme persistence and user preference management.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Theme API endpoints (save, load, delete themes)\n- User preference storage integration\n- Theme synchronization across devices\n- Server-side theme validation\n- Rate limiting and security measures\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Custom themes persist across devices for logged-in users\n- API endpoints handle theme CRUD operations\n- Server validates theme data for security\n- Rate limiting prevents abuse\n- Theme sync works reliably\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 3 (custom theme creation), User authentication system\n\n## Milestone 5: Performance Optimization and Testing (Week 7)\n**Objective**: Optimize performance and ensure comprehensive test coverage.\n\n**Deliverables**:\n- Performance optimizations for theme switching\n- Comprehensive test suite (unit, integration, accessibility)\n- Browser compatibility testing\n- Performance benchmarking\n- Documentation and user guides\n\n**Acceptance Criteria**:\n- Theme switching occurs within 200ms\n- All tests pass including accessibility tests\n- Compatible with target browsers\n- Documentation is complete and accurate\n- No memory leaks or performance regressions\n\n**Dependencies**: Milestone 4 (complete system)\n\n## Success Metrics\n- **Performance**: Theme switching < 200ms, no layout shift\n- **Accessibility**: All themes pass WCAG 2.1 AA standards\n- **User Experience**: Intuitive theme selection and creation\n- **Compatibility**: Works across all target browsers\n- **Test Coverage**: >90% code coverage with passing accessibility tests\n\n## Risk Mitigation\n- **CSS Custom Property Support**: Graceful degradation for older browsers\n- **Performance Impact**: Regular performance monitoring during development\n- **Accessibility Compliance**: Automated and manual accessibility testing\n- **User Experience**: User testing and feedback integration\n\n## Resource Requirements\n- **Frontend Developer**: React, CSS-in-JS, accessibility expertise\n- **Backend Developer**: Python/FastAPI, API design\n- **UI/UX Designer**: Theme design, accessibility consultation\n- **QA Engineer**: Testing, accessibility validation'}}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01UCL7PgJEWVZq9sBd27uA9s', 'content': '{"success": true, "message": "File written successfully to /Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan.md (backup: /Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_005035.md)", "backup_path": "/Users/mattbillock/.ensemble/backups/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/milestone_plan_20260117_005035.md", "was_overwrite": true}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_use', 'id': 'toolu_01RUcQz7egbDpbrvnCwibvUG', 'name': 'spawn_agent', 'input': {'agent_type': 'leadership/system_architect', 'input_data': {'requirements_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/requirements.md', 'output_file': '/Users/mattbillock/Development/ai_exploration/ensemble/src/field/ensemble_ui/output/architecture.md', 'project_name': 'UI Theming System'}}}]}, {